OH 6.1 product config for fajita (the port's vendor repo has no 6.1 branch):
- add the parts OH 6.1 requires that the 5.1 config lacks (rust_libc, skia, notofonts, alsa-lib, ... as in rk3568)
- drop init_feature_loader (unknown in 6.1) and wifi_feature_with_hdi_chip_supported=false (HalDeviceManager build error)
- power_suspend.json: no auto-suspend on screen timeout. Suspend makes dwc3 disconnect, which drops hdc
  (the port's USB_NOTES.md issue B1, route 1). The power key still suspends.

